  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Pattern: Xを{吐|は}く (to exhale/vomit X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates ongoing action. {吐|は}いている = 'is exhaling/vomiting.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {息|いき}を{吐|は}く (to exhale)\n- {吐|は}きそう (feels like vomiting)\n- {嘘|うそ}を{吐|は}く (to tell a lie)\n- {弱音|よわね}を{吐|は}く (to complain, show weakness)\n- {本音|ほんね}を{吐|は}く (to reveal true feelings)\n\nCONTRAST:\n- {吐|は}く - to exhale/spit out\n- {吸|す}う - to inhale/suck in\n\nIDIOMS:\n- {嘘|うそ}を{吐|は}く (to lie)\n- {弱音|よわね}を{吐|は}く (to whine, complain)\n- {本音|ほんね}を{吐|は}く (to speak honestly)",
